Rule files (frontend.md, php.md, scss.md) and BEST_PRACTICES.md each have a "Context Efficiency" section that is a **word-for-word duplicate** of AGENTS.md § Token Optimization. Because these rule files are auto-loaded by Claude Code on every matching file edit, the duplicate content burns tokens on every session. Additionally, two memory files are obsolete. Brand docs are already well-routed but can be organizationally cleaned up.

